        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "へぇ……。\r\nこの写真、いいかも。",
            "enText": "Hm… This picture's nice.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3726574681860521538,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カレンチャン",
            "enName": "Curren Chan",
            "jpText": "あれっ？\r\nもしかしてウマスタ始めたんですか～？",
            "enText": "Oh? Have you started an Umastagram?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 306552065908611550,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "……見てるだけ。\r\n星空の写真、綺麗なのが結構あったから。",
            "enText": "…I was just looking. There are a lot of good\nphotos of the starry sky on there.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 1025337000253308223,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カレンチャン",
            "enName": "Curren Chan",
            "jpText": "星か～。確か、前にアヤベさんも星空撮って\r\nましたよね？　アカウント作らないんですか？",
            "enText": "The stars, huh. You take photos\nof the night sky too, don't you?\nAren't you gonna post them?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 8098997974096629058,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "遠慮しとく。\r\nそういうのするタイプじゃないし。",
            "enText": "I'd rather not. That's not really my thing.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 1679201644370927612,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カレンチャン",
            "enName": "Curren Chan",
            "jpText": "あ～。アヤベさん、好きなものはひっそり\r\n独占したいタイプっぽいですしね～♪",
            "enText": "Ah, true. You seem like the type to keep your\nfavorite things to yourself…♪",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4206830999423097450,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "ちがっ……！",
            "enText": "That's not tru—",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -6308282764974743928,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カレンチャン",
            "enName": "Curren Chan",
            "jpText": "違うならどんどんシェアしましょうよ～？\r\nウマスタ、楽しいですよっ♪",
            "enText": "Then don't hold back — share your pics\nwith us! Umasta is fun, you know!♪",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 7421882526368110201,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カレンチャン",
            "enName": "Curren Chan",
            "jpText": "アヤベさんならタグは～、\r\n『#アヤベ　#の　#キラキラ流星群\n#一生の思い出　#天体観測で夢気分』かな？",
            "enText": "Let's see, for tags you could use… #Ayabe,\n#SparklyMeteorShower, #OnceInALifetime,\nand #StargazingGoals.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 8089705936810127922,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "夢……気分……？\r\n……いやほんと、見るだけでいいから。",
            "enText": "Stargazing… goals? …No, you know what,\nI'm really okay with just looking.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -4303195244483927677,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
